# Git ignore for HyperClip project backup

# Large archives
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz

# Sensitive and session data
**/*-Data/
**/chrome-profiles/
**/TikTok-Profiles/
**/Crashpad/
**/.cache/
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/app/data/
**/.hyperclip/
*.lock
*.png
tools/tiktok_orig.qml
tools/ffmpeg_wrapper/ffmpeg.exe
tools/ytdlp_wrapper/yt-dlp.exe

# Media, downloads, renders
**/downloads/
**/renders/
**/media/
temp_auto_push.bat
**/*.mp4
**/*.mkv
**/*.avi
**/*.mov
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.webm

# Heavy binary dependencies & libraries exceeding GitHub limit (100MB)
**/*.dll
**/*.pyd
**/*.pdb
**/app/_internal/PySide6/
**/app/_internal/resources/ffmpeg/
**/app/_internal/resources/node/
**/websub-relay/cloudflared.exe

# Node modules
**/node_modules/

# Local backup directories
**/app.backup-*/
**/Thư mục mới/
.gitignore
branch_structure.json

**/app/hyperclip-tauri.exe
**/app/qml/
.vscode/
public/
